  "title": "Battle of Kursk",
  "summary": "In July and August 1943 German forces attacked the Soviet salient around Kursk in western Russia, beginning on 5 July. Soviet defences and minefields stopped the advance within days, and a Soviet counteroffensive from 12 July retook Orel and Kharkov. It was the last major German offensive on the Eastern Front.",
